# Raw machine test and coverage output is never committed under this evidence tree.
#
# The evidence of record is the distilled per-command markdown alongside these paths, each
# carrying Timestamp:, Command:, EXIT_CODE:, and Output Summary: with the numeric headline
# figures extracted. The raw artifacts are large and the repository's standing convention is
# against committing them; the maintainer removes committed raw Cobertura on sight.
#
# The repository-root .gitignore already excludes *.coverage and *.coveragexml, and excludes
# coverage/* at the root. It does NOT exclude *.trx or *.cobertura.xml, and this plan writes
# Cobertura into this tree at P0-T14 and P7-T6, so a `git add -A` in this worktree would
# otherwise stage them. The two patterns below close that gap.
#
# Mirrors the convention established at
# docs/features/active/winformspumphost-suite-determinism-511/evidence/.gitignore.

*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.cobertura.xml

# vstest per-run scratch directories. The date-stamped form is the default results layout; the
# Deploy_* form is the deployment scratch directory, whose default name embeds the account and
# host name and is therefore also a host-identifier leak.
Deploy_*/
20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]_*/
